DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppiieecc driver supports ACPI Embedded Controllers.  It provides embed‐
     ded controller access for other ACPI devices.  On many systems which have
     an aaccppiieecc device, other ACPI devices such as acpiac(4), acpibat(4), and
     acpitz(4) implicitly depend on the aaccppiieecc device.

